                     NodePosX=-382
                     NodePosY=-224
                     NodeWidth=768
                     NodeHeight=400
                     NodeComment="This state is used as a quicker way to return to the character\'s AnimBP when not playing an end-of-wallrun landing animation. The main blend between the character\'s AnimBP and this linked AnimBP has a longer blend time (~0.4s) to allow for that landing animation, but the long blend doesn\'t work well with other transitions. This state can get us to the character\'s AnimBP earlier, while the main blend is still transitioning to it."
                     NodeGuid=3EEA8C424CB223DE6B3D5083F8B771EC
                  End Object
